{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aff215b7-36ca-8f76-a814-d545bbfd350e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T10:23:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. Thank you for answering. My name is Cristina Correia. I would like to ask about a couch, please. I want to put it out for the trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a couch. Sure. Is it regular pickup day you're thinking of, or you want a bulk pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am not sure, excuse me. I think it is bulk. The couch is very big, it does not go in the bin. [pause] I am sorry, I am on the speaker, I hope you can hear me well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. So, couch, too big for the bin. Yeah, that's usually a bulk item, and it normally needs to be scheduled ahead of time, not just left at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And how do I schedule? Please, I do not want to leave it and then receive a problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, good thinking. I'd want the details checked on how the bulk pickup works for your route. I can have a supervisor give you a call back on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be very good. I would like a supervisor to call me, please. Because I want to be sure of the instructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Let me write that down. Cristina Correia, couch, bulk pickup, supervisor callback. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-two. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Excuse me, I am watching the clock, because a movie begins in one hour and I must leave soon. Will the supervisor call this morning, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put it through right now. Might be this morning, might be after lunch. If you miss it they'll leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. Thank you very much, Kevin. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Correia. Enjoy the movie."
    }
  ],
